WEBVTT

00:00:27.876 --> 00:00:30.796
like the mouth of a dead fish.

00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:37.596
Tense muscles of uncles and aunties

00:00:37.596 --> 00:00:39.396
that hauled cement for the seawall,

00:00:39.396 --> 00:00:41.556
cooked meals for the hungry bellies.

00:00:42.196 --> 00:00:44.596
Release in relief.

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:48.196
The tides have gone out.

00:00:50.756 --> 00:00:54.956
I look to my grandparents’ graves,

00:00:54.956 --> 00:00:57.796
intimate with limp seaweeds.

00:00:59.076 --> 00:01:00.756
The disrespect.